/staging/
*.tmp

# Agent-instruction files for this repo's own dev workflow (herdr-review
# protocol, coding-agent guidance) -- untracked, not gitignored-away
# entirely: `omarchy plugin add` does a plain `git clone` of this repo with
# no manifest-driven file selection, so anything tracked here ends up
# installed onto an end user's machine at ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/.
# Shipping cross-tool agent instructions to every installer is a real
# instruction-injection surface unrelated to the plugin's runtime -- see
# https://github.com/omacom/omarchy-plugin-marketplace/issues/3968. Kept on
# disk for this and any other dev checkout to use locally; just not
# distributed.
AGENTS.md
.herdr/*
